                <note rend="inline" type="source">211.68/154: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Greece</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Shantz</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-09T17:00:00-04:00">August 9, 1937—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>34. Your 59, August 2, 2 p.m. You are authorized to sign protocol, transmitting
                    one of signed copies to Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
